# georay scene: the Zugspitze massif, where terrain actually matters.
#
# 2 km of relief inside a 6 km box, which is the case that makes the whole
# tool worth having: the flat-earth error on a picked pixel is around 60 m
# here, against 4 m over the Munich plain. Press X to see the comparison.
#
#   scripts/fetch_dem.py --origin 47.435,10.99 --extent 3000

name              ZUGSPITZE MASSIF
origin            47.435,10.99
extent            3000
dem               data/dem
geoid-separation  48.0

pattern           orbit
radius            520
height-agl        220
speed             20
